response:
There are a number of ways you can make a quick buck:

  * Sell things on eBay or Craigslist;
  * Do freelance work or Uber rides on the weekends;
  * Do odd jobs in your neighborhood; and,
  * Try some online games.

But before jumping into one of these ideas, be sure to check with someone who has experience (a mentor), or do a little reading on the topic so you can figure out how much time and effort is involved.
